# Sukoon Privacy Policy

**Last updated:** September 2026  
**Effective date:** September 2026

## What We Collect

**Nothing.**

Sukoon does not collect, transmit, or store any personal data on external servers. Everything you enter—your name, profile photo, pledge history, urge logs, and streak data—is stored exclusively on your device.

## How Your Data Is Stored

All data is stored locally on your iPhone:
- Your name and music app preference: stored in iOS device storage
- Your profile photo: saved to your app's local Documents folder
- Your urge logs: saved as a local file on your device
- Your streak and pledge data: stored in iOS device storage

We have no access to any of this data at any time.

## Third-Party Services

Sukoon uses **Apple StoreKit** for subscription payments. Apple processes all payment information—we never see your payment details. Apple's privacy policy governs that data.

Sukoon does not use any analytics, advertising, or tracking services.

## Notifications

Sukoon requests permission to send you local notifications (for example, when your Lockdown Mode timer ends). These are generated on your device and do not involve any external server.

## Your Control

Since all data is stored locally, deleting the app removes everything. You can also use **Settings → Reset Sukoon** inside the app to clear all data at any time.

## Children

Sukoon is not intended for children under 13.

## Changes

If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here with a new "Last updated" date.

